TITLE CH4 delta moles in fixed-pressure gas equilibration at 150C
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1 Fixed P gas
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings dCH4
10 PUNCH GAS("CH4(g)")
END
